{
  "name": "Helve — Scheduled SEC Filing & Company News Monitor (Self-Hosted)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scheduled SEC Filing & Company News Monitor\nRuns daily on a Schedule Trigger: checks recent SEC EDGAR filings (`sec_edgar.search_filings`, $0.00) alongside live web news (`helve.web_search`) through 1 `HELVE_API_KEY` with a hard `spendLimitUsd` cap.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "sticky-3",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-3",
      "name": "Daily Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "company",
              "name": "company",
              "value": "NVIDIA",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ticker",
              "name": "ticker",
              "value": "NVDA",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "set-company-3",
      "name": "Set Target Company",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        420,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "callTool",
        "toolId": "sec_edgar.search_filings",
        "argumentsJson": "={{ JSON.stringify({ q: $json.company, forms: '10-K,10-Q,8-K' }) }}",
        "spendLimitUsd": 0.05
      },
      "id": "helve-sec-3",
      "name": "Helve: SEC EDGAR Filings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-helve.helve",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "helveApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Helve API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "webSearch",
        "query": "={{ $json.company + ' ' + $json.ticker + ' earnings OR announcement' }}",
        "searchProvider": "brave",
        "maxResults": 5,
        "spendLimitUsd": 0.05
      },
      "id": "helve-news-3",
      "name": "Helve: Web News Search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-helve.helve",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        480
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "helveApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Helve API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pipeline Stages\n1. **Schedule & Target**: **Daily Schedule** triggers every 24h; edit `company` and `cik` in **Set Target Company**.\n2. **Filings + News**: **Helve: SEC EDGAR Filings** fetches recent 10-K/10-Q/8-K filings (`$0.00`) and **Helve: Web News Search** checks recent press coverage under a `$0.02` cap.\n\n*Requires self-hosted n8n with `n8n-nodes-helve@0.1.0`.*",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-stages-3",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Pipeline Stages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        420
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set Target Company",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set Target Company": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Helve: SEC EDGAR Filings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Helve: Web News Search",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
